<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand has deployed AI-powered surveillance to target smuggling syndicates and tighten border control amid renewed clashes with Cambodia. Police in Chiang Rai seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck, while floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households across the country. The fruit sector faces a deepening labour shortage that is causing produce to rot, prompting the government to plan hiring workers from Sri Lanka for the first time. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdGFsOTRXY3FuWHNicVh2MVNSNU5VRy13Vkl1NFI0XzhUZ3k2Nl9RQk0zaDZUV2ttaVdyekRYNUlVU3FCY2Y4X2x6WllDQ1VZc0VHenBzNkFBM1BPcFlkemFJdE9zcnV1Z3BZR0ZVcWdhc01lTDJyU1N6d19TUFd2eTBTT3VKZDZlZjNMamVOeXlGR3pkczl1ZVVWTVdlYWI3RVFVTVZsUS0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thailand Business News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNR1NSTnpJb0F2LVRtTnVuMmtyOVFXY0l1eHl2Q040azAwenpuR1luVDlKbzF3dGNRQmR6NmdHZVRlcHRWc0xqeGY3WW5EZEdCYWM5MXVxU2F5dkI0blcwd04wbnNYOW1nb1dfZFhDQy1pWHg4T3dJU2V6T2N2cVAyWWczYXJpTXFwQzNaQkNlc2dzeTlNbXRzRTdkRjZobWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fruitnet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOTklGWFZWcktfWHlRVlV3aTd6NG5LN0hCYzFneldqdm8wOE81ei0tNDVnaTdCWk4yMlo1V1ZEUFFVeERfa09IZXNtRUs2SjJUbndpMDJBem5fa2N2RXZiR3J3UGJDNld0VUFEVXVXenZtN3poRXJlTExrOVRVM01GdU1Zai1RX0JUMHFMdFZFejJuZkFza0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9vQ0ZBLVNlRTBmTm52Qkppdm02Ymk1Q3ZldlpyYnhQYTFYd3hHSmhjcjlLTFVvLVltel9pRXgyU0Y0eDJUdUtSQlJoRlV3ODZXdUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;គណបក្សប្រជាជនកម្ពុជា&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times